{"title":"Thak Warlord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 70 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 3 recorded drops, 725 total, 173–298 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×173–298</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-mace\" title=\"Titanium Mace - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab2218963a9ff8a74162.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-sapphire\" title=\"Gem Sapphire - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2220daf9c672592009e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Sapphire</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-arms\" title=\"Titanium Arms - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bb0d8fcc8405579f74ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-feet\" title=\"Titanium Feet - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/47101fc28bf0320da498.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-shield\" title=\"Titanium Shield - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/4610da8f61c75c640565.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Shield</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-onyx\" title=\"Gem Onyx - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Onyx</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-legs\" title=\"Thorn Legs - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/bbfb7a0266082704f652.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Thak Fortress</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 36</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6705\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/warlord-ozrakh\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e0083922563676141ba9.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Warlord Ozrakh</b><span>Lv 70</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-gatewarden\">Thak Gatewarden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(65)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-forgemaster\">Thak Forgemaster</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-war-captain\">Thak War-Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(67)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-warlord\">Thak Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(75)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/3dc2e11a5fe42631c1b7.webp\" alt=\"Thak Warlord\"></div><h3>Thak Warlord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>70 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 70–70)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>525</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>43</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}